feat: DS v2.0 revamp — onboarding, one-screen modal, reward fix, auto-pop, content + reward logic

Implements the YoNumbers Revamp Review across seven areas.

Design System v2.0:
- Remap tokens to Econet Blue #001B8D anchor, Econet Red #E2231A action,
  Rewards Amber #FFB020 accent, Ink/Slate; 14px card radius, 8px rhythm.
- Type: Sora (display) + Manrope (body). DS focus ring (Digital Blue + halo).
- Brand stars now Rewards Amber with an Ink outline + soft glow (never white-on-amber).

Onboarding / portal entry:
- Loading splash now routes into the Login screen; compliant tagline.
- /auth flow (Login/Subscribe tabs + red underline, +263 input, Select Package
  Daily/Weekly/Monthly, OTP timer + Confirm, Success tick + Continue, Econet
  co-brand + T&C/FAQ footer) carried to v2.0; demo login preserved.

Pick a Card pop-up — one screen, no scroll:
- Full-height (100svh) flex column with safe-area insets; header + 3×4 grid +
  status + Econet footer all visible at once, nothing clipped.
- Grid is aspect-locked and sized from remaining height (min-h-0), so it fits
  360×640 up to large displays, portrait and landscape.

Reward reveal:
- Reward renders on its own top layer above the tiles (never overlapped).
- Three stars as one centred, evenly-spaced group in front of the ribbon —
  centre larger + raised, outer smaller + symmetric, full stars, staggered pop-in.

Login auto-trigger:
- After login, the pop-up auto-opens once per session (persisted flag) with a
  "Congratulations! You qualify…" entry state + red Play & Win CTA + Maybe later;
  respects already-played / out-of-picks (shows the right state). Still available
  from the menu and Home promo card.

Content + reward logic:
- Info page rebuilt with compliant About / How to Play & Win Big / FAQ / Terms.
- Tunable reward config (lib/rewardConfig.ts): Daily Number tiers (§6) + points
  engine K/weights/flips/streak (§7); lib/dailyNumber.ts match logic; gameService
  reads the config; Home shows Today's Daily Number + the user's match tier.

tsc + next build pass; all routes 200.

